### String Message
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/kafka/publish/string
Content-Type: application/json

"Hello, Kafka World!"

### String Message with Key
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/kafka/publish/string/order-123
Content-Type: application/json

"Order placed successfully"

### User Object
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/kafka/publish/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user-12345",
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "phone": "+1-555-123-4567",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "createdAt": "2026-04-12T10:30:00"
}

### Generic Event with User Payload
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/kafka/publish/event
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-20260412-001",
  "eventType": "USER_CREATED",
  "payload": {
    "userId": "user-67890",
    "firstName": "Jane",
    "lastName": "Smith",
    "email": "jane.smith@example.com",
    "status": "ACTIVE"
  },
  "timestamp": "2026-04-12T10:35:00",
  "source": "USER_SERVICE",
  "version": "1.0"
}

### Generic Event with Order Payload
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/kafka/publish/event
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventType": "ORDER_PLACED",
  "payload": {
    "orderId": "ORD-2026-001",
    "customerId": "CUST-123",
    "amount": 99.99,
    "items": [
      {
        "productId": "PROD-001",
        "quantity": 2,
        "price": 49.99
      }
    ]
  },
  "timestamp": "2026-04-12T11:00:00",
  "source": "ORDER_SERVICE",
  "version": "1.0"
}

### Generic JSON Object
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/kafka/publish/json/custom-events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customField": "customValue",
  "nested": {
    "data": "value"
  },
  "array": [1, 2, 3],
  "timestamp": "2026-04-12T11:30:00"
}

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/kafka/health

